# The safe-mode flag stops automatic actions at once; turning it off lets the plan run.
start desk
at 5 cmd safe-mode on
at 10 exit wayvr sig=11
expect 30 runs 0
expect 30 would start wayvr
at 40 cmd safe-mode off
expect 42 ran start wayvr
# explicit user commands still work in safe mode
at 60 cmd safe-mode on
at 70 cmd toggle perf off
expect 72 ran stop perf
